</SPT></SPT><SPT><TTL>VERIFICATION OF DIMENSIONS</TTL><BRK/>
<BRK/>
<TXT>The Contractor is responsible for the coordination and proper relation of their work to the building structure and to the work of all trades.  
Verify all dimensions of the building that relate to fabrication of the crane and notify the Contracting Officer of any discrepancy before finalizing 
the crane order.</TXT><BRK/>
